  "body": "## Problem and resulting behavior\n\nThe completed Connect Four module and the original Lumo facial/PCM speech and Treasure fixes need one source-bound Host/Native candidate. This draft connects them as version 0.13.8+2020, pinned to Native 504c8ba70d02702cbccc370d0d96c36a292c5d27.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Wire the Dart authority, Android Activity/Binder bridge, Godot scene and durable round lifecycle for Connect Four.\n- Preserve the original Lumo model and existing modules while integrating the reviewed facial capture, PCM envelope and Treasure title fixes.\n- Retain the 48 existing Native modes and require four Studio2020 modes, 16 original PNGs, three sidecars and the actual facial movie.\n- Require the actual Dart/Godot two-process gate, Android API35 input tour, 2017-to-2020 update and signed APK/PCK/source verification.\n- Prepare a verified test bundle only after all six required jobs succeed. The active workflow has read permissions and does not publish a release.\n- Keep main, the base integration branch, producer branches and the separate PR483 run unchanged.\n\n## Validation already completed\n\nThe implementation tree at bdced7beb49dd37bc8bf86ea2115c6ad242a672c passed 114 targeted tests with zero failures/skips and actionlint on the three changed workflows. This activation commit changes evidence files only. Full original logs, source hashes and complete compressed evidence are included under docs/evidence/host-c4-final-validation-20261114.\n\nSeparate retained checks include 70 real JVM contract assertions (23+17+30), 41 Native gate/helper tests and exact original producer evidence. These are not claims of Android playback, combined renderer success or 60 FPS.\n\n## Pending real acceptance\n\nThis draft activates the fresh seven-job C4 workflow for exact Host 682f5991feb49d3a73ab7e2b42e23af725857ea9. The new signed APK build, actual combined Native52/Dart/Godot run, Android tour, update test and final delivery bundle remain pending until their original results succeed. No new release or public APK download is claimed.\n\n----\n## Summary by Gitar\n\n- **New village route:**\n    - Adds the Dorfwirtschaft portal, opening the Godot `settlement` scene from the Spielwelt hub\n- **Kart Garage:**\n    - Recovers the `gecko_velo` card through bounded list scrolling with original OCR evidence\n- **Native 3D hub:**\n    - Connects the Spielwelt hub entry and native notice export\n- **Diktat input:**\n    - Binds Wort-Diktat progress input to the existing ink surface\n- **Lumo Cards:**\n    - Opening message now names the player who starts\n\n<sub>This will update automatically on new commits.</sub>",
